### Создать сотрудника (Ошибка 500)
POST {{employeesPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Иван",
  "surname": "",
  "email": "petrov",
  "phone": "6540845",
  "password": "securePass123",
  "role": "ERR"
}

### Создать сотрудника (ошибка валидации 400)
POST {{employeesPath}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Иван",
  "surname": "",
  "email": "petrov",
  "password": "securePass123",
  "role": "MANAGER"
}
